id: revert
name: Revert
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# The Forms and Enhancements in use ticked to leave (use-maneuver.mjs), what leaving each does with them (transformations.mjs
# leaveTransformations: Exhausting, Fading). Rampaging's Compelled forbidding it: the table's.
reverts: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Exit any number of Forms or Enhancements of your choice.
text: >
  Revert Maneuver [1/Round]: Release a transformed state and return to your base form.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Exploitable: N/A
  –Effect: Exit any number of Forms or Enhancements of your choice.
